---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftReuseOptionReview
---
Construct a ReuseOptionReview draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Compare concepts using exact supplied estimates, known constraints, functional benefits, and unresolved conditions. Present phased or contingent options and clear next decisions, separating creative promise from verified technical or regulatory feasibility.
